From d35d0c97e6f3b79b9cce13acf2c5518d3b15179e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: myamusashi <myamusashi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:55:12 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] surface: fix partial damage for layer surfaces, background
 effects, and hyprland surfaces

- Only damage full layer geometry on layout-affecting committed state or
geometry changes
- Only damage changed layer boxes in arrangeLayerArray and damageMonitor
when usableArea changes in arrangeLayersForMonitor
- IHyprRenderer::damageRegionDiff to short-circuit equal regions,
compute symmetric differences, scale/clip, and damage changed rects
- Use damageRegionDiff uniformly in CBackgroundEffect
- Short-circuit unchanged visible regions and opacity changes in
CHyprlandSurface, delegating visible-region diffs to damageRegionDiff
---
